WEBVTT

00:13:58.961 --> 00:14:00.478
just as other athletes followed

00:14:00.478 --> 00:14:02.052
after Sir Roger Bannister

00:14:02.052 --> 00:14:04.190
ran under four minutes in the mile.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:05.817
Changing technology, changing genes,

00:14:05.817 --> 00:14:08.215
and a changing mindset.

00:14:08.215 --> 00:14:09.999
Innovation in sports,

00:14:09.999 --> 00:14:11.656
whether that's new track surfaces

00:14:11.656 --> 00:14:13.120
or new swimming techniques,

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.990
the democratization of sport,

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:16.331
the spread to new bodies

00:14:16.331 --> 00:14:18.916
and to new populations around the world,

00:14:18.916 --> 00:14:20.969
and imagination in sport,

00:14:20.969 --> 00:14:22.405
an understanding of what the human body

00:14:22.405 --> 00:14:24.186
is truly capable of,

00:14:24.186 --> 00:14:26.078
have conspired to make athletes stronger,

00:14:26.078 --> 00:14:28.601
faster, bolder,

00:14:28.601 --> 00:14:30.578
and better than ever.